      "checked_markdown_lines": [
        "BP 220 Revised IRR 2008: BP 220 applies to economic and socialized housing projects and sets minimum design standards. Locator: BP 220 refined markdown lines 107-127, 147-177, 231-237, 254-293, 422-459, 600-634, and 743-745",
        "BP 220 Revised IRR 2008: Non-saleable areas include open space, circulation, community facilities, and parks/playgrounds when required. Locator: BP 220 refined markdown lines 107-127, 147-177, 231-237, 254-293, 422-459, 600-634, and 743-745",
        "BP 220 Revised IRR 2008: Minimum lot and floor areas are category-specific and should not be mixed across housing types. Locator: BP 220 refined markdown lines 107-127, 147-177, 231-237, 254-293, 422-459, 600-634, and 743-745",
        "PD 1096 RIRR 2004 - DPWH Official: The Code regulates use, occupancy, location, site, design, maintenance, and conversion. Locator: PD 1096 RIRR refined markdown lines 75-85, 566-570, 762, 921-923, 1092-1149, 1174-1201, and 2916",
        "PD 1096 RIRR 2004 - DPWH Official: Floor plans must identify rooms or functional spaces. Locator: PD 1096 RIRR refined markdown lines 75-85, 566-570, 762, 921-923, 1092-1149, 1174-1201, and 2916",
        "PD 1096 RIRR 2004 - DPWH Official: Buildings are classified according to use or character of occupancy. Locator: PD 1096 RIRR refined markdown lines 75-85, 566-570, 762, 921-923, 1092-1149, 1174-1201, and 2916",
